WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.743
Your app deserves a home you control.

00:00:02.743 --> 00:00:10.974
Platform turns your own Ubuntu server into a connected developer platform, with Kubernetes underneath and one place to manage it.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.363
Install the CLI, provision your server, and connect your repository.

00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:26.028
GitOps with Argo CD keeps your application manifests in sync with the cluster.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.182
Bring your app's data and operations together.

00:00:33.182 --> 00:00:37.397
Provision PostgreSQL, MongoDB, and Redis.

00:00:37.397 --> 00:00:43.780
Manage encrypted secrets, inspect logs, and follow application metrics from the dashboard.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.296
Connect your AI tools through MCP with scoped agent tokens.

00:00:50.296 --> 00:00:54.977
Commands are validated, and destructive actions need human approval.

00:00:54.977 --> 00:00:56.081
Your server.

00:00:56.081 --> 00:00:57.277
Your apps.

00:00:57.277 --> 00:00:58.820
Start with the docs.
